{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>This\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>This is what I\u2019m most afraid of.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You need to know how little control they truly have.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>How little control I have</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>What\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>What have you done to their face\u2026?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/c9bNV6.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Project Songbird Teaser: Faceless</strong></i>\u00a0is a short, surreal, atmospheric first-person horror experience from Conner Rush and his studio FYRE Games, the developer behind the critically praised games\u00a0<i>Summerland</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>We Never Left (from Dread X Collection 5)</i>.\u00a0 \u00a0Navigate your path forward in the ever-changing labyrinth of the Appalachian forest.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/IYlJX2.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/BJWt0G.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/IYlJX2.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and unnerving atmosphere reminiscent of surrealist horror films</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling, immersive sound design that places you right into the shoes of our poor, poor protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An esoteric narrative sure to leave you wanting more... and more will come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and optional paths, including multiple endings determined by your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/4QAmFW.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Project Songbird</i></strong><i>\u00a0is releasing </i><strong><i>Q1 2026\u00a0</i></strong><i>on Steam, PS5, and Xbox Series X|S.<strong>  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Project Songbird Teaser: Faceless</strong></i>\u00a0is made to be its own complete, standalone experience.\u00a0 It is not fully representative of the final version of\u00a0<i><strong>Project Songbird</strong></i>, and some gameplay has been intentionally altered for the purposes of this teaser.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MESSAGE FROM THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, everyone! This is Conner. I just wanted to briefly say thank you for checking out my game and an extra special thank you to anyone who's supported me in any way throughout the creation of it. This is by far the most personal game I've ever made, and I think that'll be easy to see for anybody who plays through it. Much of the process for making this game involved just trying a bunch of weird ideas, and I think that, in the end, it all came together really well. No matter what, I'm proud of it, and I'm very happy to have made it. I hope it can help you in the way that it's helped me. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to reach out with any questions, comments, or concerns.\u00a0 Just keep in mind that I'm a solo developer and will respond to the best of my ability :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"unfinished.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3437660/d6d59d5f664f1439655318601f36c451a15d9c35.jpg"},{"name":"freed.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3437660/05a5ccffea77ec0671eb2dea4b0f84a690fc9878.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437660?t=1761241843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437660?t=1761241843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/8bfb84e858a8ba75f57d7cc9aa13f8a009ae26e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761241843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/8bfb84e858a8ba75f57d7cc9aa13f8a009ae26e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761241843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>This\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>This is what I\u2019m most afraid of.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You need to know how little control they truly have.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>How little control I have</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>What\u2026</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>What have you done to their face\u2026?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/c9bNV6.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Project Songbird Teaser: Faceless</strong></i>\u00a0is a short, surreal, atmospheric first-person horror experience from Conner Rush and his studio FYRE Games, the developer behind the critically praised games\u00a0<i>Summerland</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>We Never Left (from Dread X Collection 5)</i>.\u00a0 \u00a0Navigate your path forward in the ever-changing labyrinth of the Appalachian forest.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/IYlJX2.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/BJWt0G.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/IYlJX2.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark and unnerving atmosphere reminiscent of surrealist horror films</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chilling, immersive sound design that places you right into the shoes of our poor, poor protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An esoteric narrative sure to leave you wanting more... and more will come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and optional paths, including multiple endings determined by your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/4QAmFW.gif?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Project Songbird</i></strong><i>\u00a0is releasing </i><strong><i>Q1 2026\u00a0</i></strong><i>on Steam, PS5, and Xbox Series X|S.<strong>  </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Project Songbird Teaser: Faceless</strong></i>\u00a0is made to be its own complete, standalone experience.\u00a0 It is not fully representative of the final version of\u00a0<i><strong>Project Songbird</strong></i>, and some gameplay has been intentionally altered for the purposes of this teaser.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MESSAGE FROM THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, everyone! This is Conner. I just wanted to briefly say thank you for checking out my game and an extra special thank you to anyone who's supported me in any way throughout the creation of it. This is by far the most personal game I've ever made, and I think that'll be easy to see for anybody who plays through it. Much of the process for making this game involved just trying a bunch of weird ideas, and I think that, in the end, it all came together really well. No matter what, I'm proud of it, and I'm very happy to have made it. I hope it can help you in the way that it's helped me. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to reach out with any questions, comments, or concerns.\u00a0 Just keep in mind that I'm a solo developer and will respond to the best of my ability :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/extras/U+EIg5.png?t=1761241843\" /></span></p>","developers":["FYRE Games","Conner Rush"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3180410","name":"Project Songbird"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437660/4d33ea84a80b8db5890091d4474565df37eba56b/header.jpg?t=1761241843","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437660/1289766091/8541866ab9b8dc5cb7a529ff3fce5a8da2302990/1761000614/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761241839","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437660/1289766091/8541866ab9b8dc5cb7a529ff3fce5a8da2302990/1761000614/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761241839","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3437660/1289766091/8541866ab9b8dc5cb7a529ff3fce5a8da2302990/1761000614/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761241839","id":257220267,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220267/movie480.mp4?t=1761241839","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220267/movie_max.mp4?t=1761241839"},"name":"Project Songbird Teaser: Faceless | Trai